      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A cylinder is a three-dimensional solid figure which has two identical
    circular bases joined by a curved surface at a particular distance from the center
    which is the height of the cylinder. Toilet paper rolls, cold drink cans are
    real-life examples of cylinders. \n\n<b>Formula: <i>V=\u03C0r<sup>2</sup>h</i></b>"
